# Token-efficient project map

## Prefer these paths
- Player: `src/player/` (`PlayerProvider.tsx`, `mediaSession.ts`, `nowPlaying.ts`)
- iOS Now Playing / AVPlayer: `ios/App/App/NowPlayingPlugin.swift`, `MainViewController.swift`
- Tracks/covers: `src/data/songs.ts`, covers under `public/assets/covers/`
- UI: `src/pages/`, `src/components/`

## Do not
- `@` whole `ios/`, `android/`, `node_modules/`, `dist/`, or `public/assets/audio/`
- Paste large lockfiles or binary assets into context
- Re-explore the whole repo when the task is clearly in `src/player` or one Swift file

## Habit
- Open/new chat per distinct task when context gets heavy
- Grep/read only the files needed; use Explore subagent for broad “where is X” searches
